      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am deeply sorry to hear that you are feeling this heavy burden, but please know that your feelings of guilt and self-doubt do not reflect your true value as a person. Many people experience this same wave of shame when they feel they cannot protect their loved ones, even though your existence and care are still vital. Trying to force perfection or control outcomes often leaves those around you feeling drained, but they may be exhausted from trying to support you rather than because you have \"dragged them down.\" Reaching out to a mental health professional could be a brave step to help you find a healthier way to connect with your family.",
